  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.58,
      591.94,
      523.21,
      610.35
    ],
    "text": "In terms of the Sale of Goods Ordinance goods of a description",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      85.78,
      624.34,
      525.57,
      642.75
    ],
    "text": "and accordance with the description, it has to be of a merchantable quality. If",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.250448226928711,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      85.66,
      656.5,
      490.06,
      674.91
    ],
    "text": "not the buyer has the option to reject it. In the case in hand the Plaintiff-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.753722190856934,
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      514.64,
      33.4,
      523.49,
      49.15
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.66,
      69.47,
      523.29,
      87.88
    ],
    "text": "buyer had numerous difficulties and I would hold that he is entitled to be",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.730775833129883,
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.51,
      101.62,
      523.44,
      120.03
    ],
    "text": "duly compensated for the loss caused to him due to the defect in the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.38,
      134.26,
      139.31,
      152.67
    ],
    "text": "machine.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.52,
      187.25,
      351.71,
      203.09
    ],
    "text": "Charles Worth's Mercantile Law - lih Ed. Pg. 209 ...",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      13.346945762634277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.59,
      229.01,
      523.43,
      244.76
    ],
    "text": "Merchantable quality means \"that the goods in the form in which they were tendered",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.39,
      249.88,
      523.14,
      265.63
    ],
    "text": "were of no use for any purpose for which goods which complied with the description",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.764596939086914,
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.38,
      271.02,
      523.25,
      286.76
    ],
    "text": "under which these goods were sold would normally be used, and hence were not saleable",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.63,
      291.88,
      522.87,
      307.66
    ],
    "text": "under that description\" (per Lord Reid in B. S. Brown & Sons Ltd. v. Craiks Ltd. (1970)",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.199999809265137,
      11.43443775177002,
      11.623632431030273,
      11.649591445922852,
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      87.43,
      312.76,
      523.51,
      328.51
    ],
    "text": "1 W.L.R 752, 755). Consequently, goods are not of merchantable quality if, in the state in",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.37,
      333.65,
      522.7,
      349.39
    ],
    "text": "which they are tendered, (1) they have defects unfitting them for their ordinary use, or (2)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.37,
      354.28,
      523.01,
      370.03
    ],
    "text": "their condition is such that no reasonable buyer, with knowledge of their true condition,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.755014419555664,
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.14,
      375.16,
      522.97,
      390.91
    ],
    "text": "would accept them in performance of the contract. The fact that the defect can be easily",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.28,
      395.8,
      523.15,
      411.55
    ],
    "text": "cured, e.g. by washing an irritant out of woolen underwear or by making some trifling",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.39,
      416.68,
      523.04,
      432.42
    ],
    "text": "repair, is immaterial. Merchantable quality does not mean that there will be purchasers",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.4,
      437.55,
      522.94,
      453.31
    ],
    "text": "ready to buy the goods, or that the goods will comply with the law of a foreign country,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.740449905395508,
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.72,
      458.44,
      505.99,
      474.22
    ],
    "text": "so as to be saleable there. (Summer, Permain & Co. v. Webb & Co. (1922) 1 K.B. 55).",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.199999809265137,
      11.477030754089355,
      11.691400527954102,
      11.701539039611816,
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      158.3,
      499.55,
      523.48,
      517.96
    ],
    "text": "In all the circumstances of this case I do not wish to interfere",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.38,
      532.17,
      523.19,
      550.59
    ],
    "text": "with the views of the learned District Judge. I affirm the judgment of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.76,
      564.58,
      400.53,
      582.99
    ],
    "text": "learned District Judge. Appeal dismissed without costs.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      158.13,
      596.98,
      263.67,
      615.39
    ],
    "text": "Appeal dismissed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
